# auth.func

> Module: auth (Kimlik Doğrulama) | Category: CORE | is_core: TRUE

## Purpose
Authentication and authorization module. Handles user registration, login, JWT token management, Google OAuth, and email verification. This is a core module that cannot be disabled — every tenant needs authentication.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish logistics companies need secure multi-user access with different roles
- Company owners need to create accounts for their employees (drivers, office staff, accountants)
- Users expect modern OAuth login options (Google) in addition to email/password
- KVKK compliance requires proper authentication and session management

## Technical Database Structure
**Tables used:**
- `tenants` — Company records (slug, plan, locale, country_code)
- `users` — User accounts (email, password_hash, rol, tenant_id, aktif)
- `password_resets` — Password reset tokens
- `subscriptions` — Auto-assigned FREE plan on signup

**Key columns:**
- `users.rol` — user_rol_enum: SUPER_ADMIN, TENANT_OWNER, DRIVER, OFFICE, ACCOUNTANT
- `users.aktif` — boolean, must be true to login

**Security measures:**
- bcrypt password hashing (cost=12)
- JWT with HS256, 1-year expiry for tenant users
- Claims embedded: user_id, tenant_id, email, role, allowed_modules
- Login lockout: 5 failed attempts → 15-minute block
- Signup rate limiting: 3 per 15 minutes per IP
- Password strength: 8+ chars, 1 uppercase, 1 digit, 1 special

## User Interface
**LoginPage.tsx** — `/login`
- Email + password form
- "Hesap Oluştur" link for new users
- Google OAuth button (Google icon + "Google ile Giriş Yap")
- Dark themed with orange (#FF5F03) accent

**Signup flow (embedded in LoginPage):**
- Company name, email, password fields
- Redirects to dashboard on success

**VerifyEmailPage.tsx** — `/verify`
- Email verification confirmation page

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/signup` | Public | Company registration + tenant creation |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Public | Email + password → JWT token |
| POST | `/api/auth/google` | Public | Google OAuth hybrid login |

## Known Bugs
- None open. All B-SET series bugs in the auth/settings boundary are fixed.
- Signup works but email verification may not send in QA (B-QA-01 related: SES approval pending).

## Test Coverage
- QA test: 3/4 passed (75%) — 1 false negative due to SPA hydration timing
- CI gate: RequireTenant rejects super admin, password validation exists, email validation exists, signup lockout exists
